WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.700
This is my team, one badge at a time.

2
00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:07.800
Márcia reconciles statements, projects cash flow and prepares the month-end close.

3
00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:09.900
Invoices are Maria's job.

4
00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:13.400
Contracts, Aline reviews with the law as her source.

5
00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:17.600
Geane takes care of people, from hiring to time tracking.

6
00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:22.300
On WhatsApp, Davi sells, from first contact to booked meeting.

7
00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:26.400
And when the request is too big, Juliana coordinates the team with me.

8
00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:28.900
That's 21 specialists, plus me.

9
00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:32.100
How many you get depends on the plan.

10
00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:35.500
You only talk to me, they handle the rest.
